{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんは！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本日、映画「闇金ウシジマくん Part3」が公開になりました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"その中で私は、りなという女の子を演じています！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"りなはすごく真っ直ぐで積極的な女の子で、私とは違った女性ですが、彼女の生きていく姿など、ウシジマくんのキャラクターの中でも唯一共感してもらえる役になっていると思います。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当に面白く、楽しめる作品になっているので、男女問わず是非たくさんの方に観て頂けたら嬉しいです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shiraishi/img/mai.shiraishi/img/2016/09/22/4579072/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"撮影してた時の写真を載せようかな"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shiraishi/img/mai.shiraishi/img/2016/09/22/4579072/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shiraishi/img/mai.shiraishi/img/2016/09/22/4579072/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一枚目は屋上で。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"二枚目は待ち時間に...\nどこのシーンでしょうか。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一部のメンバーも観てくれたみたいで嬉しい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"１ヶ月後にはファイナルも公開されるので、Part3と合わせて観てほしいです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日はLINE LIVE「さしめし」に出ます！\n山田孝之さんとです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"是非みてください(^^)/"}],"source":"archive"}